# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║         web-host/ Folder .gitignore                             ║
# ║     cPanel and server-specific files protection                 ║
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  cPanel Server Files (Never commit to git)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# cPanel configuration and setup (server-specific, never committed)
/cpanel/
/cPanel/
.htaccess
index.php
composer
config/

# Server-specific binaries and executables (except scripts)
*.bin
*.exe

# Except deployment scripts (these must be committed)
!/scripts/
!/scripts/*.sh

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Exceptions - Files to Keep Committed
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Keep deployment scripts
!scripts/
!scripts/*.sh

# Keep GitHub Actions workflows
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!.github/workflows/*.yaml

# Keep documentation
!DEPLOYMENT_SCRIPTS_GUIDE.md
!readme.md
!README.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Notes
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This folder contains:
#   ✅ /scripts/ → Deployment automation scripts (committed)
#   ✅ /.github/ → GitHub Actions CI/CD (committed)
#   ✅ Documentation → Guides and readmes (committed)
#   ❌ /cpanel/ → Server setup (local only, not committed)
#   ❌ composer → Server binary (local only, not committed)
#   ❌ .htaccess → Server config (local only, not committed)
